ine control is sensitive to timing and server settings; public-server results are not a stable benchmark.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Install matching client and server versions and start a local server with one fixed map.","Record server settings and disable uncontrolled changes between trials.","Use demos or a custom harness to preserve inputs and detect finish or reset events.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Complete a fixed map section using movement, jump and hook inputs.","Modify a physics or collision rule and compare recorded runs.","Test two cooperating clients and measure synchronization, completion and failed interactions.","AI 使用与评估条件","The client/server source enables instrumentation. Preserve map authorship and data licenses when sharing fixtures or replays; conduct repeatable tests on a local server.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Code, data and third-party licenses","https://github.com/ddnet/ddnet/blob/master/license.txt","Steam release","https://store.steampowered.com/app/412220/DDraceNetwork/","Official source and local server instructions","https://github.com/ddnet/ddnet","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":100},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Game data defaults to CC BY-SA 3.0; fonts and other files have exceptions recorded in license.txt.","assetLicense","代码许可","zlib for project code, with bundled third-party licenses.","codeLicense","开始使用",[122],"access",{"_58":123,"_25":102,"_124":125},"Free Steam game","note","Free game and local server binaries. Use a private local server for controlled evaluation.","主要来源",[129],"sourceUrl",{"_58":126,"_25":104},"技术栈","C++ / CMake / networked precision platformer","stack","适用方向",[136],"dimensions","2D","测试目标",[140,141],"uses","代码修改与自动试玩","视觉、控制与规划","资源类型","游戏与引擎项目","lead","summary","project",[158,159],[157],{"_58":123,"_25":102,"_124":